  "question": {
    "text": "The set of all values of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></math>&nbsp;for which the line <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>&nbsp;bisects two distinct chords drawn from a point <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><mfenced><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>a</mi></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>a</mi></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math> on the circle <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mo>(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>)</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mo>(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>)</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>, is equal to :"
  },
  "options": [
